     "titulo": "Short messages",
     "texto": [
      "In a short message, it is best to include the main detail from the start.",
      "The compound **tekstmelding** joins two nouns; in Norwegian many concepts are formed by joining words together, without spaces. Unlike English «text message», it is written as one word."
